<view class="safe-page chat-page">
  <view class="chat-title-row"><view><text class="page-title">八条</text><text class="page-subtitle">今天也要被好好陪伴喵~</text></view><view class="level-badge">Lv.{{cat.level}} {{progress.formName}}</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{initializationError}}" class="initialization-error"><text class="initialization-error__title">本地数据需要恢复</text><text class="initialization-error__body">{{initializationError}}（阶段：{{initializationStage}}）</text><button class="initialization-error__button" loading="{{retrying}}" disabled="{{retrying}}" bindtap="retryInitialization">重试</button></view>
  <view class="cat-card card"><cat-display cat="{{cat}}" state="{{catState}}" bind:pet="onPet" /><view class="cat-accessibility-note"><text>点击或长按猫咪摸摸；同一次长按后的重复点击会被抑制。</text><text>状态专用图片缺少时显示 idle 素材和轻量动效；图片加载失败会显示 Emoji 占位。</text></view><view class="status-row"><view class="status-item"><text>饱食度</text><view class="mini-track"><view style="width: {{cat.hunger}}%;"></view></view><text>{{cat.hunger}}</text></view><view class="status-item"><text>心情</text><view class="mini-track mini-track--mood"><view style="width: {{cat.mood}}%;"></view></view><text>{{cat.mood}}</text></view><view class="status-item"><text>今日喂养</text><text class="feed-count">{{cat.todayFeedCount}}/3</text></view></view><view class="experience-bar"><view class="experience-bar__head"><text>经验进度</text><text>{{progress.experience.current}}/{{progress.experience.need}}</text></view><view class="experience-track"><view class="experience-value" style="width: {{progress.experience.percent}}%;"></view></view></view><view class="cat-actions"><button class="secondary-button" disabled="{{feeding}}" bindtap="feed">🍙 喂八条</button><button class="ghost-button" disabled="{{petting}}" bindtap="onPet">♡ 摸摸</button></view></view>
  <view class="care-tip" wx:if="{{careTip}}">{{careTip}}</view>
  <view class="upgrade-tip" wx:if="{{upgradeTip}}">✨ {{upgradeTip}}</view>
  <scroll-view class="message-scroll" scroll-y="true" scroll-into-view="{{scrollIntoView}}" enhanced="true" show-scrollbar="false">
    <view wx:if="{{!messages.length}}" class="chat-empty"><text>🌷</text><text>和八条说说今天吧</text></view>
    <view wx:for="{{messages}}" wx:key="messageId" id="msg-{{item.messageId}}"><chat-bubble message="{{item}}" /></view>
    <view id="chat-bottom" class="chat-bottom"></view>
  </scroll-view>
  <view class="input-bar"><input class="chat-input" value="{{inputValue}}" maxlength="500" confirm-type="send" bindinput="onInput" bindconfirm="send" placeholder="和八条说点什么…" /><button class="send-button" loading="{{sending}}" disabled="{{sending}}" bindtap="send">发送</button></view>
  <view class="heart-layer"><text wx:for="{{hearts}}" wx:key="*this" class="heart" style="left: {{item.left}}%; animation-delay: {{item.delay}}ms;">♥</text></view>
</view>
